        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 118911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Antes de podermos começar a consultar uma tabela de banco de dados, precisamos, é claro, primeiro criar a tabela e preenchê-la.</p><p>Vamos dar uma primeira olhada na criação de uma tabela <code>Directory</code> com colunas para o número do <code>floor</code> e <code>company</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, &quot;ACME Inc.&quot;);\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"ACME Inc.\" /></row></table></tables></database></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A sintaxe básica para criar uma tabela SQL sempre começa com as palavras-chave <code>CREATE TABLE</code> seguidas pelo nome da tabela.</p><p>Agora, é a sua vez de criar a tabela <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>CREATE</code> seguido de <code>TABLE</code> e finalmente <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A sintaxe básica para criar uma tabela SQL sempre começa com as palavras-chave <code>CREATE TABLE</code> seguidas pelo nome da tabela.</p><p>Crie a tabela <code>Directory</code> vazia, em vez de alterar ou inserir em uma tabela.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ALTER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DATABASE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>CREATE</code> seguido de <code>TABLE</code> e finalmente <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition",
            "id": 118913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em seguida, precisamos declarar quais colunas queremos criar. Adicionamos o nome de cada coluna, seguido pelo seu tipo de dado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>floor</code> seguido de <code>INTEGER</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Declare as colunas que quer criar. Adicione o nome de cada coluna seguido do tipo de dado.</p><p>Use <code>INTEGER</code> para números inteiros e <code>TEXT</code> para texto.</p><p>Dê à coluna floor um tipo de número inteiro e mantenha company como texto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"level\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TEXT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directory\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>floor</code> seguido de <code>INTEGER</code> e finalmente <code>company</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II",
            "id": 121132,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os tipos de dados de coluna válidos incluem <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (para números de ponto flutuante) ou <code>TEXT</code>. Você também pode usar <code>BLOB</code> ou <code>NULL</code>, mas não abordaremos esses tipos aqui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>company</code> seguido de <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os tipos de dados de coluna válidos incluem <code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> (para números de ponto flutuante) ou <code>TEXT</code>. Você também pode usar <code>BLOB</code> ou <code>NULL</code>, mas não abordaremos esses tipos aqui.</p><p>Armazene um nome de empresa na segunda coluna, não um número nem um valor ausente.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTEGER\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"REAL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>floor</code> seguido de <code>company</code> e finalmente <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Inserting Values",
            "id": 120194,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma vez que a estrutura da tabela é criada, tudo o que resta é inserir alguns valores. Já cobrimos esse conceito.</p><p>Podemos inserir quantos valores quisermos, sempre que quisermos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>INSERT</code> seguido de <code>INTO</code> e finalmente <code>VALUES</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Após criar a estrutura da tabela, insira alguns valores usando a sintaxe que você aprendeu.</p><p>Use a declaração que adiciona linhas para inserir cada empresa e andar em <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"FROM\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TABLE\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>INSERT</code> seguido de <code>INTO</code>, <code>Directory</code> e finalmente <code>VALUES</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Seeing a created table",
            "id": 120195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aqui está a tabela <code>Directory</code> com valores adicionados.</p><p>Observe como as linhas e colunas são estruturadas e como elas acabam ficando em uma tabela.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE Directory (&#xA; floor INTEGER,&#xA; company TEXT&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (1, 'Acme Inc.');&#xA;INSERT INTO Directory (floor, company) VALUES (2, 'Homeflix');\"><tables><table name=\"Directory\"><row><header content=\"floor\" /><header content=\"company\" /></row><row><data content=\"1\" /><data content=\"Acme Inc.\" /></row><row><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"Homeflix\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Acme Inc.'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"INSERT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTO\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\", company) \" /><text value=\"VALUES\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Homeflix'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Column Definition II - Copy",
            "id": 132699,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos adicionar <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> para garantir que a tabela seja criada apenas se ela ainda não existir, evitando erros.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>IF</code> seguido de <code>NOT</code> e finalmente <code>EXISTS</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione <code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> para criar a tabela somente se não existir e evitar erro se ela já existir.</p><p>Complete a proteção antes do nome da tabela para executar novamente sem tentar recriar <code>Directory</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IF\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"NOT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"EXISTS\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Directory\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"floor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"INTEGER\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" company \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"WHERE\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"NULL\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Directories\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>IF</code> seguido de <code>NOT</code>, <code>EXISTS</code> e finalmente <code>Directory</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118978,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Com quais palavras-chave a sintaxe para criar uma tabela SQL sempre começa?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE</code> seguido por <code>TABLE</code> seguido pelo nome da tabela</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>TABLE</code> seguido pelo nome da tabela seguido por <code>CREATE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>CREATE</code> seguido por <code>TABLE</code> seguido pelo nome da tabela.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma declaração vai criar uma tabela chamada <code>Directory</code>. Qual início permite criá-la?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>TABLE Directory CREATE</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>INSERT INTO Directory</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>CREATE Directory TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>CREATE TABLE Directory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Definition",
            "id": 118979,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais características de coluna a sintaxe de criação da sua tabela deve incluir no mínimo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O nome de cada coluna e seu tipo de dado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O nome de cada coluna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O nome de cada coluna e seu tipo de dado.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em <code>CREATE TABLE Directory (...)</code>, a coluna <code>floor</code> deve armazenar inteiros. O que deve aparecer?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nome e tipo, como <code>floor INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Somente o nome, <code>floor</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Somente o tipo, <code>INTEGER</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Um valor para inserir na coluna</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nome e tipo, como <code>floor INTEGER</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Column Data Types",
            "id": 118983,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais são alguns tipos de dados comuns de coluna?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> e <code>TEXT</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>BOOLEAN</code>, <code>TRUE</code>, e <code>TEXT</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>INTEGER</code>, <code>REAL</code> e <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use <code>INTEGER</code> para inteiros, <code>REAL</code> para decimais e <code>TEXT</code> para texto.</p><p>Você define nome da empresa, andar inteiro e avaliação decimal, nessa ordem. Qual ordem de tipos corresponde?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">TEXT, INTEGER, REAL</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">INTEGER, TEXT, REAL</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">TEXT, REAL, INTEGER</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">REAL, INTEGER, TEXT</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher TEXT, INTEGER, REAL.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Basic Syntax",
            "id": 118985,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique a sintaxe básica para criar uma tabela chamada <code>Birthdays</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>CREATE</code> seguido de <code>TABLE</code> e finalmente <code>Birthdays</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie uma tabela chamada <code>Birthdays</code>. Declare <code>birthday</code> como texto, como <code>January 3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INSERT\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTO\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Birthday\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"INTEGER\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>CREATE</code> seguido de <code>TABLE</code>, <code>Birthdays</code> e finalmente <code>TEXT</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Column Definition",
            "id": 118986,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a definição da coluna para a sintaxe de criação da tabela <code>Birthdays</code>. A tabela deve ter duas colunas: <code>name</code> e <code>birthday</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"CREATE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Birthdays (\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" birthday \" /><text value=\"TEXT\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>birthday</code>.</p></body></html>"
